        | Start Address | End Address | Description            | Documented Here |
        |---------------|-------------|------------------------|-----------------|
        | 0xE0000000    | 0xFFFFFFFF  | DDR512 MB              | &#10060;        |
        | 0xC0000000    | 0xDFFFFFFF  | Reserved 512 MB              | &#10060;        |
        | 0xB0000000    | 0xBFFFFFFF  | PCI address space 256 MB        | &#10060;        |
        | 0xA0030000    | 0xAFFFFFFF  | Reserved 255.8 MB             | &#10060;        |
        | 0xA0020000    | 0xA002FFFF  | Reserved 64 KB               | &#10060;        |
        | 0xA0010000    | 0xA001FFFF  | Reserved 64 KB               | &#10060;        |
        | 0xA0000000    | 0xA000FFFF  | USB 1.1 HOST registers 64 KB | &#9989;         |
        | 0x900B0000    | 0x9FFFFFFF  | Reserved 255.3 MB            | &#10060;        |
        | 0x900A0000    | 0x900AFFFF  | SIO1 registers 64 KB         | &#9989;         |
        | 0x90090000    | 0x9009FFFF  | Reserved 64 KB               | &#10060;        |
        | 0x90080000    | 0x9008FFFF  | VEDU registers 64 KB         | &#9989;         |
        | 0x90070000    | 0x9007FFFF  | DSU registers 64 KB          | &#10060;        |
        | 0x90060000    | 0x9006FFFF  | VIU registers 64 KB          | &#10060;        |
        | 0x90050000    | 0x9005FFFF  | VOU registers 64 KB          | &#10060;        |
