        | 0x101FB000    | 0x101FCFFF  | Reserved 16 KB               | &#10060;        |
        | 0x101FA000    | 0x101FAFFF  | GPIO7 registers 4 KB         | &#9989;         |
        | 0x101F9000    | 0x101F9FFF  | GPIO6 registers 4 KB         | &#9989;         |
        | 0x101F8000    | 0x101F8FFF  | GPIO5 registers 4 KB         | &#9989;         |
