        | 0x101F0000    | 0x101F0FFF  | Reserved 4 KB                | &#10060;        |
        | 0x101EF000    | 0x101EFFFF  | Reserved 4 KB                | &#10060;        |
        | 0x101EB000    | 0x101EEFFF  | Reserved 16 KB               | &#10060;        |
        | 0x101EA000    | 0x101EAFFF  | Reserved 4 KB                | &#10060;        |
        | 0x101E9000    | 0x101E9FFF  | IR registers 4 KB            | &#9989;         |
